timestamp=2026-10-29T17:49:12.423Z level=INFO run=56b51860 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat > result/accounts/README.md <<'EOF'\n# Test account evidence\n\n## Account A — created and verified\n- Service: Ubiquiti SSO (`account.ui.com` / `sso.ui.com`)\n- Username: qacct1a6967\n- Email: uitest1ad6967@maxxspace.com (disposable, test-owned)\n- UUID: 314f82e1-8e68-488a-ad94-96e1c252990b\n- Created: 2026-10-29T17:40:51Z; email 2FA verified 2026-10-29T17:41Z\n- Session cookie: `UBIC_AUTH` (HttpOnly) captured in `accountA-cookies.json`\n- Dashboard screenshot: `accountA-dashboard.png`\n\n## Account B — unresolved\n- Public signup was attempted with a second disposable inbox.\n- Registration returned `403 CHALLENGE_RECAPTCHA_TOKEN_REQUIRED` and then a\n  reCAPTCHA image challenge. Solving image CAPTCHAs automatically was not\n  pursued; cross-account tests that require a second identity are marked\n  **Unresolved**.\n\nThe credentials are disposable test-account credentials, not real-user data.\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-10-29T17:49:12.423Z level=INFO run=56b51860 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat > result/server-side/sso.ui.com/test-ledger.md <<'EOF'\n# SSO API test ledger — sso.ui.com\n\nAuth context: Account A (verified user), cookie `UBIC_AUTH`.\nAll requests included `Origin: https://account.ui.com`. Test traffic is under\n`traffic/`.\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Variant | Status | Result |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self | GET | settings=true&include=tenant | Not Vulnerable | Returns own profile only |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/roles | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Returns own roles |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/settings | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Own settings |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/2fa | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | 409 MFA already enabled |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/addresses | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Own addresses |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/sessions | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Own session only |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/activity | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Own activity |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Own authenticators |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/trusted_devices | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Empty own list |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self/device | GET | - | Not Vulnerable | Own device |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/{uuid}/roles/beta | POST | own uuid, {} | Not Vulnerable | 204, self-service beta role; random UUID -> 403 \"mismatching UUID\" |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self | PUT | {\"first_name\":\"Qa\"} | Not Vulnerable | 204, own field updated as expected |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self | PUT | is_admin / is_staff / roles / permissions / is_superuser / email_verified / is_verified / twofa_enabled | Not Vulnerable | Fields ignored or rate-limited (429); persisted state unchanged |\n| /api/sso/v1/user/self | PATCH | {\"first_name\":\"Qa\"} | Not Vulnerable | 405 method not allowed |\n\nNotes:\n- `POST /api/sso/v1/user/{uuid}/roles/beta` adds self-service beta roles when\n  the UUID matches the authenticated user; random UUIDs are rejected with 403.\n- SSO write endpoints rate-limited after several rapid PUTs (429); further\n  mutation tests were paused and spaced out.\n- Cross-account IDOR/BOLA tests require Account B (Unresolved due to reCAPTCHA).\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-10-29T17:49:12.423Z level=INFO run=56b51860 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat > result/inventory/endpoints.md <<'EOF'\n# Endpoint Inventory\n\n## account.ui.com / sso.ui.com (Ubiquiti SSO)\n\nBase app JS: `https://account.ui.com/assets/index-D5t7M7xo.js`\n(sha256 ce9950c975a42cac66f5c2ea759d655e96c441d34df6a6b8190b09d60ea1c468)\n\n| Method | Path | Auth | Notes | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| POST | /api/sso/v2/users | none (+captcha) | Registration | Rate-limited by reCAPTCHA challenge after tests |\n| GET | /api/sso/v1/legal | none | Terms revisions | Tested |\n| GET | /api/sso/v1/search/email/{email} | none | Email existence oracle (low impact; excluded) | Tested |\n| GET | /api/sso/v1/search/username/{u} | none | Username existence oracle (low impact) | Tested |\n| POST | /api/sso/v2/password-strength | none | Password policy check | Tested |\n| GET | /api/sso/v1/user/self | user | Profile | Tested |\n| PUT | /api/sso/v1/user/self | user | Profile update | Tested (mass assignment negative) |\n| PATCH | /api/sso/v1/user/self/settings | user | Settings update | Not yet tested |\n| GET | /api/sso/v1/user/self/roles | user | Own roles | Tested |\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/user/{uuid}/roles/beta | user | Self-service beta roles | Tested (UUID match enforced) |\n| GET | /api/sso/v1/user/self/2fa, /mfa, /sessions, /activity, /addresses, /trusted_devices, /device | user | Own security data | Tested (read-only) |\n| GET/POST | /api/sso/v1/account-chooser | none | Returns empty accounts list | Tested |\n\nOther discovered service bases in JS (not yet tested): account.svc.ui.com,\nfabric.svc.ui.com, billing.svc.ui.com, enterprise.svc.ui.com, lte-api.svc.ui.com,\nu5g-api.svc.ui.com, trunking.svc.ui.com, storage.svc.ui.com, ips.svc.ui.com,\nfeedback.svc.ui.com, nca/cloudaccess.svc.ui.com, ues.svc.ui.com, umr.svc.ui.com,\ncap.svc.ui.com, megaphone.svc.ui.com, ecomm.svc.ui.com.\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-10-29T17:49:12.423Z level=INFO run=56b51860 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat > result/unresolved.md <<'EOF'\n# Unresolved items\n\n- **Account B / cross-account IDOR & BOLA tests** — second public signup hit\n  `403 CHALLENGE_RECAPTCHA_TOKEN_REQUIRED` followed by an interactive reCAPTCHA\n  image challenge. No second authenticated identity is available, so tests that\n  require two accounts are marked Unresolved.\n- **Account B registration mass-assignment test** — same CAPTCHA blocker.\n- **Hosts returning 000 or 403 on first probe** (beta.community.ui.com,\n  security.community.ui.com, docker*.dl.ui.com, crm.trunking.ui.com,\n  stg.store.ui.com, community.status.ui.com) were not retried; recorded in\n  `result/recon/`.\n- **Store/storefront hosts** run on Shopify (third-party platform). Not deeply\n  tested because the platform is external and outside the intended application\n  surface.\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
